Build the operator-facing plan from this repository. The orchestrator persists canonical YAML (manifest.yml, targets.yml, research.yml, constraints.yml, plan.yml, gates.yml, state.yml). Do not reuse a ladder from another stack. Do not print markdown package catalogs. Do not list cargo gem/npm versions. Do not invent depends_on without an official compatibility requirement. Official latest is research, not permission to emit a runnable milestone.

